    // Per-tier sizes for idsva_so_device (inline-CUDA users only). At TIER_SHARED temp lives in s_temp; at TIER_LITE/MINIMAL it moves to d_workspace, freeing 16572*sizeof(T) bytes of smem. Frame picked at codegen time: body_frame.
